<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs up $0.50/1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs up $0.50/1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $.50</p>
<p>to $1.00 higher than Tuesday's close. Top $60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3  230-260 lbs    58.50-60.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  260-270 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>	  270-280 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs    41.00-46.00</p>
<p>	 over 500 lbs    50.00-53.00</p>
</text>
